+\(\pi_*\mathcal O_X=\mathcal O\oplus\mathcal T_\pi\).  Miranda's structure, as
+recorded in Shirane §1.1.5, gives
+\[
+\mathcal O(\Delta_\pi)\simeq(\det\mathcal T_\pi)^{-2}.
