+\(\mathcal T_\pi\simeq L^{-1}\oplus L^{-2}\), its depressed cubic has coefficients
+\[
+A\in H^0(\mathcal O(2k)),\qquad B\in H^0(\mathcal O(3k)),
+\]
+and reduced discriminant
