   213	
   214	**Verdict. NECESSARY.** Family 3 is not killed uniformly. SK-5 removes a route; it does not remove the family.
   215	
   216	What SK adds, and which may be promoted as outer structure rather than as a kill: the normal form (4.1); SK-5; the complete `g=2` split (constant dead, non-constant a single explicit `φ`-orbit). The residual mechanism is again `ι`, with
   217	
