+
+The required first Newton face of the one branch is
+\((z^\alpha-\lambda v^\beta)^2\).  If \(j=0\), write the leading term of
+\(A\) as \(a v^{2k}\).  There is no term of \(B\) below weight \(\alpha\beta\), and
