+Repeat \(T_g\) in all \(u\) blocks.  Then \(X=Y=c\), so (1.2) holds.  Let
+\(Z_g=(\sigma_1\cdots\sigma_{g-1})^g\); it has exponent \(g(g-1)\) and acts by
